    "Retail treat spells: Slice of Cake 382882 dummy 30 s; Blubbery Muffin 382761 transform into a tuskarr 20 min; Rocks on the Rocks 407063 transform into a drogbar 20 min; Sugarfree Firewater Sorbet 422075 size +25% 20 min; Snow in a Cone 382729 periodic 10 s for 10 min with one of four cones; Party Peripherals (Party Essentials 423797) dummy 5 min.",
    "CoA spells 9978102 (cake), 9978103 (muffin), 9978104 (rocks), 9978105 (sorbet), 9978106 (party), 9978107-9978110 (the four cones).",
    "Muffin and rocks share an exclusive spell group, so the newer transform replaces the older; the four cones share one too, so taking another cone keeps exactly one. Each pick draws one of the four cones at random; nine picks in a row repeat the first cone with probability (1/4)^8, so without the group the count reaches 2 in all but about 1.5e-5 of runs."
